    "### Interpretation: Model Benchmark\n",
    "\n",
    "- **Model selection criterion:** F1 Macro (equal weight per class), appropriate for uneven 10-class distribution.\n",
    "- **Baseline context:** Majority-class accuracy is only around one-quarter of samples in this setup (see printed class distribution), so a high-accuracy trivial classifier is not available.\n",
    "- **Probability quality:** ROC-AUC (OvR) indicates how well the model ranks risk for each class, which is important for downstream latent-score construction.\n",
    "- **Main challenge:** Adjacent transition classes (for example `Low_Stable` vs `Low_MildRise`) are expected to overlap and drive most confusion."
