    "## 7. Generate Latent Factors for Stage 2\n",
    "\n",
    "To avoid row-level leakage, Stage 1 probability features are generated using **out-of-fold (OOF)** predictions on the full dataset.\n",
    "\n",
    "### Outputs\n",
    "- 10 OOF class probabilities (`PROB_LOW_IMPROVE` ... `PROB_HIGH_ESCALATE`)\n",
    "- `LATENT_RISK_SCORE` (weighted aggregation of class probabilities)\n",
    "- `STAGE1_PRED_CLASS` (argmax class from OOF probabilities; used for leakage-safe Stage 2 routing)"
   ]
